    schema:description "Join Souk, a forward-thinking company that is redefining the way businesses operate in the digital marketplace. As a Full Stack Engineer, you will play a pivotal role in developing and enhancing our innovative platform, which seamlessly connects buyers and sellers across diverse markets. You will be responsible for designing and implementing robust, scalable solutions while working alongside a dynamic team of talented developers. Your expertise in both front-end and back-end technologies will be crucial in driving the success of our platform and ensuring a seamless user experience. We value creativity, collaboration, and a passion for cutting-edge technology. At Souk, we offer an exciting and challenging environment where your skills will be honed and your career advanced. If you are eager to make a significant impact and thrive in a fast-paced setting, we invite you to apply and become a key contributor to our growth and success. Tasks Develop and maintain scalable web applications using modern front-end and back-end technologies. Collaborate with cross-functional teams to design, develop, and implement new features and enhancements. Optimize application performance and ensure high-quality user experience across various devices and browsers. Troubleshoot and debug complex issues in a timely manner to ensure seamless operation of web applications. Participate in code reviews and contribute to the improvement of software development best practices. Requirements Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field. Proven experience as a Full Stack Engineer or similar role, with a strong portfolio of web applications. Experience with back-end development using languages such as Node.js, Python, or Java, and familiarity with RESTful APIs. Experience building AI Agents and Skills Benefits Equity, team trips and more Join Souk as a Full Stack Engineer and innovate at the forefront of technology. Elevate your career with cutting-edge projects and a dynamic team. Apply today for this exciting opportunity! Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
