    schema:description "We are recruiting a Nominee Director to provide limited support with company formalities and compliance. This is a part-time, non-operational role with a very small time commitment. The initial setup may require 1–2 hours, followed by occasional requirements throughout the year. Key Responsibilities: Serve as the company's appointed UK Nominee Director. Sign relevant company and banking documents remotely. Provide occasional assistance with corporate compliance matters. Compensation: £100 - £125 per month. What We Offer: Flexible remote part-time opportunity Minimal ongoing workload No day-to-day operational duties Requirements: Must be permanently resident in the UK. Comfortable using digital systems, email and online communication tools. Able to assist with occasional administrative requirements. Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
