    schema:title "Senior Analyst Business Operations (w/m/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/enpal/senior-analyst-business-operations-berlin-465086> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-senior-analyst-fpa-london-455421> a prov:Entity,
