    schema:description "You’ll be a highly hands-on engineer, responsible for rapidly prototyping, shipping MVPs, and turning product ideas into polished user experiences. You’ll work across the stack, collaborating closely with product, design, and engineering teams while operating with a high degree of independence. Key responsibilities • Build and ship new product features end-to-end • Lead rapid prototyping and MVP development • Develop modern frontend applications using TypeScript, Vue 3 Composition API, and Tailwind • Contribute to backend services using Node, Bun, Koa, PostgreSQL, Prisma, and AWS • Collaborate closely with cross-functional teams to shape product direction • Improve performance, reliability, and developer experience across the platform Requirements • Strong experience building modern frontend applications with TypeScript and Vue3 • Solid backend experience with Node-based services and relational databases • Experience working with PostgreSQL, Prisma, AWS, and REST APIs • Comfortable moving quickly, making pragmatic decisions, and shipping iteratively • Strong communication and collaboration skills • Able to work independently in a hybrid environment Working model Hybrid role with 2 days per month in the office Compensation: £75K – £85K • £18K – £22K Equity Senior Full Stack TypeScript Developer • £75K – £85K • £18K – £22K Equity Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
