    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/uplift-marketing-gmbh/werkstudent-marketing-kunzell-480172> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-werkstudent-social-media-community-management-munchen-480348> a prov:Entity,
